This project has been accepted in Physical Review Fluids:

"Size Amplification of Jet Drops due to Surfactants" by Jun Eshima\*, Tristan Aurégan\*, Palas Kumar Farsoiya, Stéphane Popinet, Howard A. Stone, Luc Deike (\* denotes equal authorship)

The pre-print is available at https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.09189.

